  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "機器人藝術創作概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION OF ROBOTIC ARTISTIC CREATION",
    "describe_ch": "新型態藝術創作，機器人領域也正在藝術領域被接受。透過機器人概論與實機教學，應用於幾何圖形設計與創作，使學員了解新型態藝術。",
    "describe_eh": "Robotic field is integrating into Artistic field as a new type of artistic creation. By following the introduction and practice of robot, students will be able to design and create a geometric figure. The lecture will give students the knowledge of the new type of art.",
